{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "519e9c56-9849-82da-b38c-09c7058a976a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:10:51-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linda Chase",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:07:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:07:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, um, hi. My name's Linda Chase. I'm calling about a tree, well, a big limb, it's down across the sidewalk on Ayrault Street. Two ninety-seven Ayrault, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:08:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, two ninety-seven Ayrault. A limb on the sidewalk. Is it blocking the whole sidewalk or just part of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:08:17-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pretty much the whole thing. It's wicked big, like thicker than my leg. It came down in that nor'easter, the one Friday into Saturday, two days ago. I just noticed it this morning, and it's totally covering the walk, so anybody going by has to step out in the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:08:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. Any wires on it or touching it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:08:39-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, [pause] I don't think so? I'm not gonna go right up to it. There's a wire up there on the pole, but the limb looks like it's lying down on the ground and the wire's still up. I think. I'm kind of nervous about it, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:08:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good call keeping your distance. Let me write this down. Limb, sidewalk, two ninety-seven Ayrault, wires look up but not confirmed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:09:04-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So who do I even call for this? Is it the city that takes it, or is it the owner of the house, or is it the electric company? Because the tree's in front of a house, but it might be on the city strip, I can't tell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:09:22-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the right question. If it's a city tree, in the street right of way, we handle it. If it's on private property, it's usually the owner's job to clear it. If it's tangled in the wires, that's the utility, and you'd call them first. Since you're telling me it's on the sidewalk, I'll put in a report and have somebody go look at whose it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:09:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good, thank you. I'm sorry, I'm actually in my van right now, I drive delivery, and I'm parked in a loading zone on the corner, so I can't stay long. Somebody's gonna wave at me any second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:10:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, we'll be quick. Do you want a call back, once somebody's looked at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:10:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'd be great. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:10:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-two. Linda Chase. Got it. Crews have been slammed since Saturday, so it may be a day or two, but I'm flagging it as blocking a sidewalk, so it moves up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:10:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if somebody trips on it before then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:10:26-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it gets worse, or you see a wire down, call back right away. For sparks or a live wire, call 911. Otherwise, if you can, put a cone or something near it. Don't move it yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:10:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I don't have a cone, but I'll see what I can do. Thanks, Kevin. I really appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:10:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Linda. Drive safe out there."
    }
  ],
